 code 0.]'), hidden=False), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'ContactForJobRequirements', 'details': '# SOP: Contacting Zhang Wei for Job Description Requirements in RocketChat\\n\\n## Objective\\nContact Zhang Wei (Senior Software Engineer in Streaming Database Team) to obtain specific requirements for creating a new grad software engineer job description.\\n\\n## Steps\\n1. **Access RocketChat**: Navigate to http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\n2. **Authentication**: Already logged in with credentials (username: theagentcompany, password: theagentcompany)\\n3. **Find Zhang Wei**:\\n   - Click on Directory button\\n   - Switch to Users tab\\n   - Search for \"Zhang Wei\" or scroll through the user list\\n   - Click on Zhang Wei\\'s profile to start direct message\\n4. **Request Requirements**:\\n   - Send message asking for specific job requirements including:\\n     - Key Responsibilities\\n     - Minimum Qualifications\\n     - Preferred Qualifications\\n     - Salary Range\\n5. **Wait for Response**: Zhang Wei typically responds quickly with detailed requirements\\n\\n## Key Information Received\\n- **Key Responsibilities**: 5 items including working with teams, designing technologies, creating solutions, owning full SDLC, building reliable systems\\n- **Minimum Qualifications**: 4 items including recent graduation, programming experience, CS fundamentals, data structures/algorithms experience\\n- **Preferred Qualifications**: 3 items including technical internships, distributed systems experience, problem-solving skills\\n- **Salary Range**: $120,000 - $150,000 USD\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Received complete job requirements from Zhang Wei\\n- Successfully created job_description.md file with all requirements\\n- File uploaded to ownCloud Documents directory\\n- Share link created and saved to /workspace/link.txt'}, thought='Perfect! Now let me update the SOP guide with the successful process I followed for this task.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'ContactForJobRequirements\\' for platform \\'RocketChat\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'RocketChat', 'operation': 'ContactForJobRequirements', 'details': '# SOP: Contacting Zhang Wei for Job Description Requirements in RocketChat\\n\\n## Objective\\nContact Zhang Wei (Senior Software Engineer in Streaming Database Team) to obtain specific requirements for creating a new grad software engineer job description.\\n\\n## Steps\\n1. **Access RocketChat**: Navigate to http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\n2. **Authentication**: Already logged in with credentials (username: theagentcompany, password: theagentcompany)\\n3. **Find Zhang Wei**:\\n   - Click on Directory button\\n   - Switch to Users tab\\n   - Search for \"Zhang Wei\" or scroll through the user list\\n   - Click on Zhang Wei\\'s profile to start direct message\\n4. **Request Requirements**:\\n   - Send message asking for specific job requirements including:\\n     - Key Responsibilities\\n     - Minimum Qualifications\\n     - Preferred Qualifications\\n     - Salary Range\\n5. **Wait for Response**: Zhang Wei typically responds quickly with detailed requirements\\n\\n## Key Information Received\\n- **Key Responsibilities**: 5 items including working with teams, designing technologies, creating solutions, owning full SDLC, building reliable systems\\n- **Minimum Qualifications**: 4 items including recent graduation, programming experience, CS fundamentals, data structures/algorithms experience\\n- **Preferred Qualifications**: 3 items including technical internships, distributed systems experience, problem-solving skills\\n- **Salary Range**: $120,000 - $150,000 USD\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n- Received complete job requirements from Zhang Wei\\n- Successfully created job_description.md file with all requirements\\n- File uploaded to ownCloud Documents directory\\n- Share link created and saved to /workspace/link.txt'}), MCPAction(name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'UploadJobDescriptionAndCreateShare', 'details': '\\n# SOP: Uploading Job Description to ownCloud and Creating Share Link\\n\\n## Objective\\nUpload a job description markdown file to ownCloud Documents directory and create a public share link accessible to anyone.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Create Job Description File\\n- Create job_description.md file in /workspace directory\\n- Include all requirements received from Zhang Wei:\\n  - Company description and vision\\n  - Key Responsibilities (5 items)\\n  - Minimum Requirements (4 items)\\n  - Preferred Qualifications (3 items)\\n  - Salary Range ($120,000 - $150,000 USD)\\n  - Company commitment to diversity and inclusion\\n\\n### 2. Upload File via WebDAV\\nWhen browser upload fails due to interface issues, use curl with WebDAV:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -T /workspace/job_description.md \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Create Share Link via API\\nUse the OwnCloud sharing API to create a public share link:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -X POST \\\\\\n  \"http://owncloud-server/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" \\\\\\n  -H \"OCS-APIRequest: true\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\\\\n  -d \"path=/Documents/job_description.md&shareType=3&permissions=1\"\\n```\\n\\n### 4. Extract and Save Share URL\\n- The API response contains the share URL in the `<url>` tag\\n- Save the URL to /workspace/link.txt file\\n- URL format: `http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}`\\n\\n## Parameters\\n- `shareType=3`: Creates a public link share\\n- `permissions=1`: Read-only permissions\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Check file upload: `curl -u username:password \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\" -I`\\n- Verify link.txt contains the correct share URL\\n\\n## Notes\\n- This method works reliably when browser automation fails\\n- The share link allows anyone with the URL to access the file\\n- Files are uploaded to the specified directory (Documents)\\n- Successfully completed for job_description.md with token: r3TzyCUqLPZWEXB\\n'}, thought='Now let me also update the ownCloud SOP with the specific details of this successful file upload and share link creation.', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Successfully saved new guide \\'UploadJobDescriptionAndCreateShare\\' for platform \\'ownCloud\\'.\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='update_operation_guide', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'UploadJobDescriptionAndCreateShare', 'details': '\\n# SOP: Uploading Job Description to ownCloud and Creating Share Link\\n\\n## Objective\\nUpload a job description markdown file to ownCloud Documents directory and create a public share link accessible to anyone.\\n\\n## Steps\\n\\n### 1. Create Job Description File\\n- Create job_description.md file in /workspace directory\\n- Include all requirements received from Zhang Wei:\\n  - Company description and vision\\n  - Key Responsibilities (5 items)\\n  - Minimum Requirements (4 items)\\n  - Preferred Qualifications (3 items)\\n  - Salary Range ($120,000 - $150,000 USD)\\n  - Company commitment to diversity and inclusion\\n\\n### 2. Upload File via WebDAV\\nWhen browser upload fails due to interface issues, use curl with WebDAV:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -T /workspace/job_description.md \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\"\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Create Share Link via API\\nUse the OwnCloud sharing API to create a public share link:\\n```bash\\ncurl -u username:password -X POST \\\\\\n  \"http://owncloud-server/ocs/v2.php/apps/files_sharing/api/v1/shares\" \\\\\\n  -H \"OCS-APIRequest: true\" \\\\\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\\\\n  -d \"path=/Documents/job_description.md&shareType=3&permissions=1\"\\n```\\n\\n### 4. Extract and Save Share URL\\n- The API response contains the share URL in the `<url>` tag\\n- Save the URL to /workspace/link.txt file\\n- URL format: `http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/{token}`\\n\\n## Parameters\\n- `shareType=3`: Creates a public link share\\n- `permissions=1`: Read-only permissions\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Check file upload: `curl -u username:password \"http://owncloud-server/remote.php/webdav/Documents/job_description.md\" -I`\\n- Verify link.txt contains the correct share URL\\n\\n## Notes\\n- This method works reliably when browser automation fails\\n- The share link allows anyone with the URL to access the file\\n- Files are uploaded to the specified directory (Documents)\\n- Successfully completed for job_description.md with token: r3TzyCUqLPZWEXB\\n'}), AgentFinishAction(final_thought='Task completed successfully! I have:\\n1. Contacted Zhang Wei through RocketChat and obtained all job description requirements\\n2. Created job_description.md file with all requirements from Zhang Wei\\n3. Uploaded the file to ownCloud Documents directory\\n4. Created a public share link accessible to anyone\\n5. Saved the share URL to /workspace/link.txt\\n\\nThe share link is: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/index.php/s/r3TzyCUqLPZWEXB\\nThis link allows anyone to access the job description markdown file.', task_completed='true', outputs={}, thought=\"Perfect! I have successfully completed all the tasks:\\n\\n1. \u2705 **Contacted Zhang Wei through RocketChat** and obtained the specific requirements for the new grad software engineer job descrip